{"title": "Magmatic Disturbance (Condition)", "pageid": 6197, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magmatic_Disturbance_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magmatic Disturbance Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Magmatic_Disturbance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Magmatic Disturbance</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The presence of this creature disturbs nearby <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lava\" title=\"Lava\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lava\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lava\" title=\"Lava\">Lava</a>, making it bubble and explode.</li>\n<li>The bubbles deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage when they explode. A DC 12 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> reduces this damage to half. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_MONKAMULET_ELEMENTALDISTURBANCE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_MONKAMULET_ELEMENTALDISTURBANCE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_MONKAMULET_ELEMENTALDISTURBANCE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Magmatic_Disturbance\">Creatures with Magmatic Disturbance</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Elemental\" title=\"Lava Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/30px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/45px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/60px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lava Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/30px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Elemental\" title=\"Lava Elemental\">Lava Elemental</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Nearby lava bubbles and explodes for 2d6 <a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a> damage.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1702/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18476/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7864/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1052837/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.058      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   58.058      1 -total\n 72.58%   42.141      3 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.49%   17.124      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 28.25%   16.401      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.25%    9.432      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 15.61%    9.062      4 Template:Icon_text\n 15.43%    8.961      1 Template:MdCharLink\n 14.76%    8.571     22 Template:Trim\n 14.52%    8.431      3 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6197-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213157 and revision id 393643. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}